# Chasing Tales (windurst 13): the offer's nation and mission sides for a Windurst char. With no Windurst mission current
# the or's second side is true: 403. With The Jester Who'd Be King (8-2) current the quest returns nil; 8-2's Tosuka
# action answers only at mission status 1 (here 0), so his script answers (no Windurst mission completed: 370).
lists WindurstWaters/Tosuka-Porika/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/403
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-27.2,-5.25,104.4 nation=2
quest Windurst.EarlyBirdCatchesTheBookworm completed
fame Windurst 125
login
trigger Tosuka-Porika               # Windurst nation, no Windurst mission current: 403
finish option=1                     # declined: nothing
mission Windurst TheJesterWhodBeKing current
trigger Tosuka-Porika               # 8-2 current: nil; his script 370
finish
